{"coverage":439,"partial":false,"day_closed":true,"window":"00:08–23:50","movers":[{"symbol":"GFSTEELS","ticker":"GFSTEELS","company":"Grand Foundry Ltd","event_type":"acquisition","quantum":"Rs 99.22 cr; ~155.6% of mcap; paid in NCDs","headline":"approves an SPA to buy **62.01% of broadband operator Tikona Infinet, 1,27,89,817 shares for Rs 99,22,00,380**, the consideration discharged in non-convertible debentures rather than cash","amount_rs":"992200380","notability_pct":"155.64","marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/8b26f8fc-bcfc-4c46-8c10-4aa76a9c2d40.pdf","mcap":81.3,"doc":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/8b26f8fc-bcfc-4c46-8c10-4aa76a9c2d40.pdf"},{"symbol":"GPTINFRA","ticker":"GPTINFRA","company":"GPT Infraprojects Limited","event_type":"order_win","quantum":"Rs 85.53 cr incl GST; ~6.0% of mcap","headline":"its wholly owned Alcon Builders wins **Rs 85.53 crore including GST (Rs 72.48 crore excluding) from Eastern Railway** for auto-signalling and electronic interlocking on the Dedicated Freight Corridor, over 12 months","amount_rs":"855300000","notability_pct":"6.03","marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GPTINFRA_12092026111121_Press_Release_intimation_Contract_win_8553_Cr_120926_sgd.pdf","mcap":1496.4,"doc":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GPTINFRA_12092026111121_Press_Release_intimation_Contract_win_8553_Cr_120926_sgd.pdf"}],"themes":{"order_wins":["**GPT Infraprojects** — its wholly owned **Alcon Builders** wins **Rs 85.53 crore including GST (Rs 72.48 crore excluding) from Eastern Railway** _(~6.0% of mcap)_ for auto-signalling and electronic interlocking over ~25 km of the Dedicated Freight Corridor, in 12 months, following its 6 August L-1 intimation.","**Adani Ports and Special Economic Zone** — discloses an order tagged **Rs 981.96 crore on a 30-year concession awarded 11 September** _(~0.24% of mcap)_, naming no counterparty. Its own size field reads \"**not ascertainable as depends on the future cargo**\", so the tag is not guaranteed revenue.","**Krystal Integrated Services** — receives a **Letter of Commencement from Maha Mumbai Metro (M3) Operation Corporation for housekeeping, facade and internal roof cleaning at the Package 4 monorail stations, Rs 6,58,35,987 including GST** _(~0.8% of mcap)_, running one year from 16 September 2026.","**Focus Lighting and Fixtures** — bags an order from **Ingka Centres India** for LED lights and fixtures, sized by the company only as a band, **in the range of Rs 5-10 crore** _(~1.2-2.4% of mcap on our arithmetic)_, for delivery by December 2026."],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":["**Aspira Pathlab & Diagnostics** — its board approves **raising up to Rs 65.00 crore by a rights issue to existing shareholders**, as equity or other convertible instruments, and constitutes a Rights Issue Committee to fix the record date, price and entitlement ratio. Subject to shareholder and regulatory approval.","**Gala Global Products** — its board approves **raising up to Rs 25.00 crore by a rights issue of Rs 5 face-value equity shares** and approves the Draft Letter of Offer for filing with BSE for in-principle approval, leaving the record date, price and ratio to a Rights Issue Committee.","**Jaihind Industries** — its board approves issuing **up to 2,36,48,000 convertible warrants at Rs 42 each, Rs 99.32 crore on our arithmetic**, to 2 promoters and 22 non-promoters, each convertible within 18 months; relevant date 11 September, AGM 11 October to seek member approval.","**Shreedhar Spinners** — its board approves **up to 9,00,900 fully convertible warrants at Rs 113, aggregating Rs 10,18,01,700**, to identified promoters and promoter group _(~3.5% of mcap)_, with Rs 2,54,50,425 payable upfront at 25% and an EGM convened for 9 October.","**TD Power Systems** — receives **in-principle approval from both exchanges for 12,50,000 equity shares to promoters on a preferential basis at not less than Rs 600 a share**, Rs 75.00 crore at the floor on our arithmetic _(~0.3% of mcap)_.","**Precision Wires India** — receives **in-principle approval from BSE and NSE for the preferential allotment of 37,50,000 compulsorily convertible debentures of Rs 400 face value**, Rs 150.00 crore on our arithmetic _(~1.8% of mcap)_, and will now allot within the ICDR Chapter V timelines.","**Saakshi Medtech and Panels** — receives **NSE in-principle approval to list 20,10,259 equity shares of Rs 10 already allotted on a preferential basis**, distinctive numbers 17656001 to 19666259; listing follows depository confirmation."],"equity_allotments":["**Gabriel India** — allots **1,44,04,204 equity shares to promoter Asia Investments for consideration other than cash**, as part consideration for its Rs 18,81,03,05,962 purchase of HL Mando ANAND India _(~7.9% of mcap)_, on a board resolution of 11 September.","**Quint Digital** — allots **82,61,401 partly paid 10% compulsorily convertible preference shares at Rs 100, Rs 82,61,40,100** _(~43.5% of mcap)_, half paid on application, plus 82,61,401 detachable warrants at Rs 10 under its rights issue.","**De Neers Tools** — allots **16,00,200 equity shares at Rs 196, Rs 31.36 crore on our arithmetic** _(~21.1% of mcap)_, plus 4,99,800 warrants at the same price, Rs 9.80 crore, to 47 named non-promoter allottees.","**VIP Clothing** — its Preferential Issue Committee allots **84,75,000 convertible warrants at Rs 22.50, Rs 19.07 crore on our arithmetic** _(~9.9% of mcap)_, to the Pathare promoter family and one non-promoter, on **Rs 9,50,06,250 of consideration already received** — 50% upfront from promoters, 25% from the non-promoter.","**Viji Finance** — receives **listing approval from BSE and NSE for 2,95,00,000 equity shares of Re 1 issued at a premium of Rs 1.80 to non-promoters on conversion of preferentially issued warrants**, distinctive numbers 191500001 to 221000000. Trading approval follows depository confirmation."],"m_and_a":["**Indiabulls** — executes a definitive agreement to buy **70% of NBFC loan-service provider Fintech Cloud for Rs 1,050 crore, on an equity valuation of Rs 1,500 crore** _(~17.3% of mcap)_, settled in up to 21 crore of its own shares through an NCLT scheme over 9-12 months.","**Airfloa Rail Technology** — signs an MoU to buy the Coimbatore business of **KIN Railway Equipment by slump sale or asset purchase for Rs 48 crore excluding taxes** _(~3.7% of mcap)_, at evaluation stage and conditional on due diligence and a definitive agreement.","**Tata Chemicals** — its wholly owned Tata Chemicals North America **completes the acquisition of Searles Valley Minerals' North American soda-ash customer contracts** on 11 September, out of Chapter 11 bankruptcy, covering **over 500,000 metric tonnes to be serviced over two years**. No consideration is disclosed.","**Waaree Renewable Technologies** — its wholly owned Waaree Green Data Centers incorporated **Sunstar Data Centers on 11 September, held 100%**, to build and operate hyperscale, AI-ready and GPU-hosting data centres. The filing records **no consideration paid**.","**Aurobindo Pharma** — its step-down subsidiary A1 Biochem Labs (India) subscribes **USD 1,000,000 in cash for 100% of newly incorporated A1 Biochem USA Inc**, to run contract research and development from the USA. No rupee equivalent is stated.","**Cochin Shipyard** — **executes the Joint Venture Agreement with Drydocks World Dubai (FZCO)**, a DP World company, signed on the sidelines of the BRICS Summit in New Delhi. No consideration, shareholding split or scope is disclosed in the intimation.","**Siemens** — issues **notices to its equity shareholders and unsecured creditors seeking representations on the amalgamation of wholly owned Siemens Rail Automation into itself**, the NCLT Mumbai having dispensed with shareholder and creditor meetings by its order of 7 September.","**Avantel** — calls a **board meeting for 18 September to consider the scheme of merger of wholly owned Imeds Global Private Limited into itself**, and closes its trading window from 13 September until 48 hours after the outcome.","**Maple Infrastructure Trust** — discloses that sponsor group entity **CDPQ Infrastructures Asia III sold 17,72,89,950 units off-market on 11 September for INR 27,02,54,13,152**, cutting its holding from 21,13,02,000 units (44.69%) to 3,40,12,050 units (7.19%)."],"capex_core":["**Munjal Auto Industries** — agrees to buy **land at Mascot Industrial City, Vitthalapur, Ahmedabad from Mascot South Asia LLP for Rs 14,31,13,640** _(~1.3% of mcap)_, for expansion of business and market share, from an unrelated seller.","**ACME Solar Holdings** — its subsidiary ACME Renewtech **commissions Phase-I of 66.68 MW out of a 300 MW solar project at Kelan, Chhatargarh, Bikaner** on 12 September, with the commercial operation date set for 14 September. No project cost is stated."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — 9 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here."],"distress_risk":["**DPSC Limited** (India Power Corporation, under CIRP) — receives **fines from NSE and MSEI for late filing of its June-quarter results, a stated financial impact of Rs 3.06 lakh**; the resolution professional says appeals for waiver will be filed.","**Kallam Textiles** — BSE levies a **fine of Rs 1,53,400 including GST for delayed submission of audited results**, which the company attributes to its ongoing CIRP and difficulty reconciling financial information; it is seeking a waiver.","**Baron Infotech** — its **first Monitoring Committee meeting notes the NCLT Hyderabad order approving the resolution plan and records receipt of Rs 2,69,03,046.49 towards CIRP cost** from Innopark (India), setting the payment schedule for operational and financial creditors and opening an escrow account.","**IRM Energy** — its **equity shareholders and unsecured creditors approve the amalgamation of Enertech Distribution Management into the company with the requisite majority** at NCLT-convened meetings on 12 September, per the scrutinizer's report.","**SKIL Infrastructure** (under CIRP) — its **eleventh Committee of Creditors meeting, begun 9 September and twice adjourned, is finally put over to 16 September** for deliberation on the agenda placed before it.","**Shivom Investment & Consultancy** — its board **approves the backlogged audited results for the quarters ended 31 March 2025 and 30 June 2025**, unfiled during its CIRP, both carrying an unmodified audit opinion, as it regularises corporate compliance for the period.","**Teerth Gopicon Limited** — Teerth Gopicon Limited (Undergoing CIRP) has informed the Exchange about Order dated 10.09.2026 passed by the Hon'ble National Company Law Tribunal, Ahmedabad Bench, in1A/1483(AHM)2026 in CP(IB)/408(A","**Bharat Bhushan Finance & Commodity Brokers Ltd** — The Company has received the Settlement Order passed by SEBI in respect of settlement applications filed under NSEL Settlement Scheme, 2025","**Axel Polymers Ltd** — Receipt of Show Cause Notice issued by the Securities and Exchange Board of India in the matter of GST.","**WeWork India Management Ltd** — Intimation regarding e-f iling of application in Form RSC-1 with the Hon’ble National Company Law Tribunal for Reduction of Share Capital (Securities Pr emium Account) of the Company","**Kalahridhaan Trendz Limited** — Notice of Adjourned 1st Meeting of Committee of Creditors (CoC) scheduled on Friday, September 11, 2026 in the matter of Kalahridhaan Trendz- Under CIRP"],"other_notable":["**Lumino Industries** — a credit-rating change: CRISIL **upgrades its long-term rating to A+/Stable from A/Stable**, short-term A1 reaffirmed, citing a Rs 3,090 crore order book and the Rs 500 crore raised in its 3 September IPO.","**KIC Metaliks** — a credit-rating change: CARE **upgrades it to BBB+/Stable and A3+ from BBB/Stable and A3** on Rs 120.01 crore of facilities, citing better capacity utilisation and gearing improving to 0.59x from 0.71x.","**RMC Switchgears** — its board approves a **purchase of industrial land from a related party**, subject to shareholder approval by postal ballot, and appoints Dilip Panjwani an additional independent director. The filing states no value for the land.","**Midwest Energy Ltd** — We refere to our intimation dated June 30, 2026 and August 08, 2026 regarding the sub-division/split of the existing equity shares of the Company. In this regard, we wish to inform you ....","**Shankara Buildpro Limited** — Shankara Buildpro Limited has informed the Exchange that Record date for the purpose of Split/Subdivision is 08-Oct-2026."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)","equity_allotments":"Equity allotments (new)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","capex_core":"Capex (core / topline)","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk","other_notable":"Other notable"},"theme_rows":{"order_wins":[{"label":"GPTINFRA","ticker":"GPTINFRA","company":"GPT Infraprojects Limited","isin":"INE390G01014","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GPTINFRA_12092026111121_Press_Release_intimation_Contract_win_8553_Cr_120926_sgd.pdf","mcap":1496.4},{"label":"ADANIPORTS","ticker":"ADANIPORTS","company":"Adani Ports and Special Economic Zone Limited","isin":"INE742F01042","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/xbrl/REG30_PARA_B_2683_WebXMLFile_20260912_002916073.xml","mcap":411740.5},{"mcap":null},{"label":"FOCUS","ticker":"FOCUS","company":"Focus Lighting and Fixtures Limited","isin":"INE593W01028","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/FOCUS_12092026152457_SEaward.pdf","mcap":403.5}],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":[{"label":"Aspira Pathlab & Diagnostics Ltd